### Create a book
POST http://localhost:8080/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "9780132350884",
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "publisher": "Prentice Hall",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Robert C. Martin",
      "birth_date": "1952-12-05"
    }
  ]
}

### Get book by ISBN
GET http://localhost:8080/book/9780132350884

### Delete book
DELETE http://localhost:8080/book/9780132350884